  "history": [],
  "facts": [
    "The Power P.E.K.K.A (formerly Super P.E.K.K.A) is the third-to-last troop unlocked in the Builder Base once the Builder Barracks is upgraded to level 10 that requires Builder Hall level 8. She is a Builder Base troop version of the P.E.K.K.A."
